# MCUboot signing keys live in this (internal) repo ON PURPOSE — security here
# is basic/formal and an offline-only key would be a single point of loss. The
# v2 batch key (keys/v2_signing_rsa2048.pem) is committed so it can't be lost.
# If this repo is ever made public, rotate that key and move it out of tree.
